From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tty: 8250: add the T41 UART

The T41 uses the same 16550-compatible Ingenic UART as the T31, with the
same FIFO sizes ("ingenic,8250-uart" in the vendor tree). Map the
compatible onto the x1000 configuration so the driver handles the module
and baud clocks and the port interrupt as it does on the T31.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_ingenic.c
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_ingenic.c
@@ -358,6 +358,7 @@
 	{ .compatible = "ingenic,jz4780-uart", .data = &jz4780_uart_config },
 	{ .compatible = "ingenic,x1000-uart", .data = &x1000_uart_config },
 	{ .compatible = "ingenic,t31-uart", .data = &x1000_uart_config },
+	{ .compatible = "ingenic,8250-uart", .data = &x1000_uart_config },
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, of_match);
